  "description": "Is it time to get back into Affirm? 🤔 OKLO Review ☢️",
  "body_html": "<p>This episode we described how to to use the 52 period high/low. Ever read an article and it says something like “This (insert stock) just broke its 52-week high!” But have you ever asked yourself…how did that stock GET to its 52 week high? </p><ul><li><p>https://www.tradingview.com/script/psJIvzS1-Tim-s-High-Lows/</p></li></ul><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;Timothy James&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa4c61c40-9364-4166-877a-b0163fb9610d_854x854.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p>The answer is relatively simple but largely overlooked.…</p>",
